  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific contract for organising regional events</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The global objective is to provide professional event organisation services with the aim to promote EU relations with Central Asia, the Middle East, Gulf as well as Afghanistan in the context of implementing international partnerships, development cooperation and Global Gateway. The focus of the activities will be on Central Asia. The overall assignment is a complex series of events.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
